cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use these kernels, cite ANNY, whose head they fit.
title: Head-fit kernels (Lean-emitted) -- fitting ANNY's head to an avatar face
abstract: >-
  lean/HeadFit/SlangCodegen/*.lean write, as LeanSlang compute kernels, the
  blend of ANNY's macro and local targets and its backward, the similarity
  (rigid + scale) and its VJPs, the point-to-surface and landmark residuals,
  the prior, a df32 energy sum, and the barycentric resample that carries a
  fitted action onto the avatar (RFD 2275, RFD 2277). They are written here;
  no ANNY source is copied. The phenotype anchor rule restates
  anny-creator's scripts/anny_coeffs.gd, checked against it in Godot
  (gates/11-headfit). lake exe emit_headfit writes the Slang and the pins;
  gen.sh compiles cpp and SPIR-V and embed_spv.exs embeds it (no Python).
type: software
authors:
  - name: NAVER LABS Europe
repository-code: https://github.com/naver/anny
license: Apache-2.0
